{"Noda|His fins are lit — break away, now!": {"f": "161abb3608ac.mp3", "d": 1.96}, "Tachibana|Shikishima! The guns on your Zero — it's the only thing that can hurt it. Go!": {"f": "cb3245afd1fe.mp3", "d": 4.86}, "Tachibana|Stay wide of it! Don't let it see you!": {"f": "c1f4367faed2.mp3", "d": 2.25}, "Tachibana|You're in! Wait until it's close… now! Shoot!": {"f": "2f4dd41e8786.mp3", "d": 3.14}, "Tachibana|Shikishima! What are you doing?! SHOOT!": {"f": "5209ef859df5.mp3", "d": 2.25}, "Akitsu|Shikishima, you're on the gun. The cable's cut — pop them as they come up!": {"f": "e1d54e49304a.mp3", "d": 4.45}, "Mizushima|Nice shooting! More coming up to port!": {"f": "86a26600711f.mp3", "d": 2.49}, "Noda|Steady. This last field is a big one, and the swell is carrying them faster.": {"f": "01a9b012fea0.mp3", "d": 4.76}, "Akitsu|That's the lot. Not bad for a pilot.": {"f": "2cbb53c09d59.mp3", "d": 2.25}, "Noda|Deep-sea fish… floating belly up. Something very large is driving them to the surface.": {"f": "b1535ffc7dd7.mp3", "d": 5.83}, "Akitsu|…Let's get home.": {"f": "c672ff8020dc.mp3", "d": 1.6}, "Akitsu|It's coming! Full ahead! Shikishima, slow it down!": {"f": "c69b56a8eebb.mp3", "d": 3.98}, "Mizushima|The thirteen-mil isn't even scratching it!": {"f": "760454cdd9f8.mp3", "d": 2.3}, "Mizushima|You got it! Right in the mouth!": {"f": "980f86317592.mp3", "d": 2.02}, "Akitsu|Guns are useless! Let go a mine — blow it up under him!": {"f": "2ea2b8190bc1.mp3", "d": 3.87}, "Noda|One mine left. Put it right in front of him!": {"f": "f2669a994fe7.mp3", "d": 2.07}, "Noda|A direct hit and it hasn't even slowed…": {"f": "caf35ed1f7d5.mp3", "d": 1.94}, "Akitsu|It's got the mine in its jaws — the wire's snapped! Shikishima, shoot it!": {"f": "907c4c6cdd8c.mp3", "d": 5.18}, "Noda|It's healing. The flesh is knitting back together as we watch…": {"f": "b4186aaf5fc5.mp3", "d": 3.79}, "Akitsu|Look — the Takao! She made it!": {"f": "00d32e4dee82.mp3", "d": 2.02}, "Mizushima|It went under!": {"f": "03e7f766eaa5.mp3", "d": 1.13}, "Noda|Its fins — they're lighting up. Everybody get down!": {"f": "c88b7e5b3159.mp3", "d": 2.67}, "Akitsu|A heavy cruiser… gone. In one breath.": {"f": "738729c7002e.mp3", "d": 2.25}, "Koichi|Noriko… she's somewhere up this street.": {"f": "2a1ee92aec43.mp3", "d": 2.3}, "Noriko|Koichi?! Why did you come here?": {"f": "7d32b72673d4.mp3", "d": 1.83}, "Koichi|No time — run!": {"f": "311142f67ab4.mp3", "d": 1.6}, "Koichi|NORIKO!": {"f": "2a019ab5b919.mp3", "d": 1.05}, "Noda|Shikishima — he is heading inland. Make him angry and bring him out to the trench!": {"f": "23853228e6d5.mp3", "d": 5.13}, "Noda|He has turned! Keep him following — the destroyers are waiting past the marker.": {"f": "0c506d8301ae.mp3", "d": 5.23}, "Noda|He is losing interest. Go back and sting him again!": {"f": "69d76bb83e22.mp3", "d": 3.09}, "Noda|You are too far ahead of him — stay where he can see you.": {"f": "0e7d54d6f226.mp3", "d": 3.27}, "Noda|He is over the trench! Destroyers — begin your run!": {"f": "1ae246a0e856.mp3", "d": 3.04}, "Noda|Yukikaze, Hibiki — begin circling. Shikishima, do not let him look at the ships!": {"f": "30a43258f407.mp3", "d": 5.49}, "Noda|The loop is closed! Activate the Freon tanks!": {"f": "278ecc7e68f2.mp3", "d": 2.49}, "Noda|Fifteen hundred metres… and it is still moving.": {"f": "d399725fd8e2.mp3", "d": 3.27}, "Noda|Inflate the balloons. Bring it up — fast!": {"f": "67091900ffbc.mp3", "d": 2.15}, "Akitsu|It bit through a balloon! It has stopped at eight hundred metres!": {"f": "fec0ddc2feac.mp3", "d": 3.51}, "Noda|Then we pull it up ourselves. Both ships, full power!": {"f": "dd45faf0d6b7.mp3", "d": 2.57}, "Mizushima|Shinsei Maru and every tugboat in the bay, reporting for duty!": {"f": "ee8940033b35.mp3", "d": 3.69}, "Akitsu|Yukikaze is hit! She cannot take another one!": {"f": "f715cc01fb39.mp3", "d": 2.43}, "Akitsu|Hibiki is hit! She cannot take another one!": {"f": "e77a8f153b79.mp3", "d": 2.25}, "Noda|That is it — he is back on you!": {"f": "c4aa3b6ced20.mp3", "d": 1.89}, "Noda|He is turning on the Yukikaze! Get his attention!": {"f": "3faa951380f7.mp3", "d": 2.57}, "Noda|He is turning on the Hibiki! Get his attention!": {"f": "bc7f2a4a3006.mp3", "d": 3.09}, "Noda|It is up! …And it is still alive.": {"f": "90529fdafc89.mp3", "d": 2.15}, "Noda|His fins are rising. If that heat ray fires, the whole fleet is gone.": {"f": "375c494506cf.mp3", "d": 4.24}, "Koichi|Then I end it. Here and now.": {"f": "9a3fe6835b44.mp3", "d": 1.78}}